{
  "duration": 79.339,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 0.259,
      "text": "So"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.62,
      "end": 1.459,
      "text": "welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.979,
      "end": 3.079,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.579,
      "end": 4.279,
      "text": "Now, in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.839,
      "end": 6.44,
      "text": "a woman travels the first"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.96,
      "end": 8.42,
      "text": "one hundred kilometers"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.96,
      "end": 10.5,
      "text": "at fifty kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.019,
      "end": 13.319,
      "text": "She travels the next one hundred kilometers"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.799,
      "end": 15.679,
      "text": "at one hundred kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.239,
      "end": 19.879,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find the average speed for the whole journey."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.299,
      "end": 20.979,
      "text": "Be careful here."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.539,
      "end": 24.319,
      "text": "We should not simply take the average of fifty and one hundred."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.819,
      "end": 26.199,
      "text": "Average speed is equal to"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.879,
      "end": 29.179,
      "text": "total distance divided by total time."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.699,
      "end": 30.039,
      "text": "First,"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.379,
      "end": 33.939,
      "text": "let us find the time taken for the first one hundred kilometers."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.419,
      "end": 37.52,
      "text": "We know that time is equal to distance divided by speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.04,
      "end": 40.599,
      "text": "So the first time is one hundred divided by fifty,"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.059,
      "end": 42.759,
      "text": "which gives us two hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.159,
      "end": 46.719,
      "text": "For the next one hundred kilometer, the time is one hundred divided by one hundred."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.239,
      "end": 48.299,
      "text": "This gives us one hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.759,
      "end": 52.239,
      "text": "Now, the total distance is one hundred plus one hundred, which is two hundred kilometers."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.699,
      "end": 54.959,
      "text": "The total time is two plus one, which is three hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.299,
      "end": 55.599,
      "text": "Got it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.139,
      "end": 56.479,
      "text": "Perfect."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.939,
      "end": 60.639,
      "text": "Now, average speed is equal to total distance divided by total time."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.139,
      "end": 64.299,
      "text": "So the average speed is two hundred divided by three."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.839,
      "end": 69.159,
      "text": "This gives us approximately sixty-six point six seven kilometers per hour. Hence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.58,
      "end": 79.339,
      "text": "the average speed for the whole journey is sixty-six point six seven kilometers per hour. So the final answer will be option D, sixty-six point six seven kilometers per hour."
    }
  ],
